<p>Your body's internal organs are indistinct, disguising your vital areas.</p><p>You have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 25%, 34%, 42%, 50%</acronym> chance to shrug off all direct critical hits (physical, mental, spell).</p><p>In addition you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">19%, 35%, 45%, 52%, 58%</acronym> resistance to disease, poison, wounds and blindness.</p>